<title>USA: Southwest Water sets 20 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Southwest Water sets 20 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>WEST COVINA, Calif. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Water Co Friday said it has declared a special 20 percent common stock dividend, payable on January 20, 1997 to stockholders of record at January 2, 1997.</p>
<p>The company believes the stock dividend will add to the number of shares available for trading and increase market float and liquidity for investors.</p>
<p>The company has 2.6 million shares outstanding as of October 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
